@AquaBlend.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5194
@AquaBlend.Api_Token = replace-with-a-valid-jwt

### Health
GET {{AquaBlend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Get all water sources
GET {{AquaBlend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/water-sources
Accept: application/json

###

### Get water source by ID
GET {{AquaBlend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/water-sources/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Create water source
POST {{AquaBlend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/water-sources
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sample Water Source",
  "name": "Main Reservoir",
  "type": "Surface"
}

###

### Update water source
PUT {{AquaBlend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/water-sources/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Water Source",
  "name": "Updated Reservoir",
  "type": "Surface"
}

###

### Delete water source
DELETE {{AquaBlend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/water-sources/1

###

### Get all scenarios
GET {{AquaBlend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/scenarios
Accept: application/json

###

### Get scenario by ID
GET {{AquaBlend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/scenarios/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Create scenario
POST {{AquaBlend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/scenarios
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sample Scenario",
  "description": "Sample optimisation scenario"
  "name": "Summer Supply Scenario",
  "description": "Scenario for summer water demand."
}

###

### Update scenario
PUT {{AquaBlend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/scenarios/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Scenario",
  "description": "Updated optimisation scenario"
  "name": "Updated Summer Scenario",
  "description": "Updated scenario description."
}

###

### Delete scenario
DELETE {{AquaBlend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/scenarios/1

###

### Get all optimisation results
### Get optimisation results
GET {{AquaBlend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/optimisation-results
Accept: application/json

###

### Get optimisation result by ID
GET {{AquaBlend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/optimisation-results/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Get optimisation results by scenario
GET {{AquaBlend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/optimisation-results/scenario/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Create optimisation result
### Planned contract - implementation depends on the Run/Result workflow
POST {{AquaBlend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/optimisation-results
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scenarioExternalId": "SCN-001",
  "status": "OPTIMAL",
  "solvedAt": "2026-09-20T10:00:00Z",
  "receivedAt": "2026-09-20T10:01:00Z",
  "contractVersion": "1.0",
  "resultJson": "{\"objectiveValue\":1250.50}",
  "totalCost": 1250.50,
  "currency": "USD"
}

###

### Get changes since timestamp
### Get changes
GET {{AquaBlend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/changes?since=2026-09-20T09:00:00Z
Accept: application/json

###

### Get current authenticated user
GET {{AquaBlend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AquaBlend.Api_Token}}
